  "description": "Teammachine SLR 01 TWO is peak BMC: the ultimate carbon climbing bike with minimal weight, next-level power transfer, razor sharp handling, advanced aerodynamics, and a ride feel shaped in our Impec Lab to be lighter, sharper, and faster than ever.\nIts ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame brings ruthless stiffness for both uphill and downhills whilst remaining featherweight, while evolved aerodynamics across the frame unlock free speed – bringing our most advanced lightweight road bike closer than ever to the Teammachine R 01 in outright aerodynamic performance.\nWith TCC Race compliance and sharp handling, it carries the unmistakable BMC character across changing gradients, making it comfortable on rough roads and precise in the corners.\nAdd the Shimano Dura-Ace Di2 drivetrain with 4iiii power meter, the next-gen ICS Carbon Aero cockpit, and DT Swiss ARC 1100 DICUT 38 mm wheels, and you complete a build made for decisive efforts in the mountains.",
